  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Independently qualify original-domain and numeric-loss boundaries for the exact Math console: replay original IR, distinguish formal derivative from solving, recheck unrestricted candidates against original exclusions, and require explicit binary64 rounding/error. Observe a compiled missing-API RED, 41 GREEN tests, eight pinned NuGet boundary probes, the retained eight-probe console and seven inspected local archives. Complete only C01-T2 and C01; keep M5-W02 and M5 open.",
    "value": "Deliver a separately verified, provider-neutral numerical/symbolic public Math vertical with typed rejection of invalid sources, original-domain holes, mismatched derivative/solver pipelines and unauthorized rounding. Preserve exact IR, source provenance and numerical loss independently.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS075 success, prepare M5-W02-C02-T1 clean versioned package restore and qualification matrix for admitted Math capabilities, without assuming multi-OS support or public stable release.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Observe one compiled missing public ExactVerticalBoundaryAudit API RED against the previously qualified distribution preview.1 before installing preview.2.",
      "Reuse the qualified canonical source/IR, symbolic differentiation, exact point evaluation, unrestricted candidate solver, original root audit, numerical conversion and composition engines.",
      "Independently recheck original typed IR canonical JSON, semantic structural hash, original assumption and bounded UTF-8 source fingerprint without treating the fingerprint as proof.",
      "Recheck derivative of the original BODY separately from original equation root solving; retain x!=1 exclusion and distinguish complete unrestricted candidates from original-audit completeness.",
      "Require explicit binary64 rounding consent, exact absolute error and distinct exact/approximate composition; refuse unsupported shapes or source/pipeline mismatches without partial results.",
      "Recover the compiled RED and pass 41 new GREEN MSTests, locked Release solution build and six related symbolic, numeric, composition, codecs, IR and quantities regressions.",
      "Inspect seven locally rebuilt net10 NuGet packages with nuspec graph, actual byte lengths and SHA-256; execute eight package-only boundary probes and the retained eight-probe console.",
      "Close only C01-T2 R/G/V, T2 and C01 with precise science evidence. Keep M5-W02 and M5 in-progress, and C02/C03 not-ready.",
      "Repair the RS075 pre-attempt CS0219 refusal: remove the unused SampleSource payload declaration. The failed invocation allocated no attempt and changed no product files."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M5-W02-C01-T2-R",
        "achievement": "Observe one genuinely compiled missing independent public numerical/symbolic boundary audit API RED against distribution preview.1."
